---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="Cookie policy" description="Stay Prepped does not set advertising or tracking cookies. Here is what we store on your device and why." updated={new Date('2026-10-24')}>
  <p><strong>We do not set any cookies.</strong> That is why you do not see a cookie banner.</p>
  <h2>What we do store on your device</h2>
  <p>Our free tools save your inputs and last result in your browser's local storage, and we remember your light or dark theme if you choose one. This information never leaves your device. It is strictly necessary for the features you use, so it does not need consent under the Privacy and Electronic Communications Regulations (PECR).</p>
  <p>You can remove it at any time with the clear buttons on each tool, or by clearing this site's data in your browser settings.</p>
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>If we use analytics, it will be a cookieless service. It does not store anything on your device.</p>
  <h2>If this changes</h2>
  <p>If we ever need non-essential cookies, we will ask for your consent first and update this page. See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for more.</p>
</PageLayout>
